we'll drop the lawsuit against the mistress.</i>

729
01:00:51,347 --> 01:00:55,174
So that's why you held back the complaint.
To keep that card.

730
01:00:55,174 --> 01:00:59,576
She used to live off of 1.5 million won
in a house under Lee Jun Sik's name.

731
01:00:59,576 --> 01:01:04,272
But now she'll live in a co-owned house
with 4 million won for living expenses.

732
01:01:07,101 --> 01:01:11,084
But will Ms. Lee be able to keep living there?

733
01:01:11,084 --> 01:01:13,794
The trauma from the bedroom would be severe.

734
01:01:14,622 --> 01:01:19,906
But wouldn't financial therapy be the only way
to get over that trauma?

735
01:01:19,906 --> 01:01:23,874
And that will be Ms. Lee's space now.

736
01:01:23,874 --> 01:01:25,806
[Notice of contract termination]

737
01:01:25,806 --> 01:01:30,042
Lee Jun Sik and Jung Yu Seon will be ruined
because of the penalty fees.

738
01:01:30,042 --> 01:01:31,822
This costs a billion won, what now?

739
01:01:31,822 --> 01:01:35,692
What do you mean? We did it together,
so we should each pay 500 million won.

740
01:01:35,692 --> 01:01:37,360
You petty jerk.

741
01:01:37,360 --> 01:01:39,962
You came on to me first, so you pay.

742
01:01:39,962 --> 01:01:44,928
- You filmed and leaked the video!
- You said you could divorce if I did that!

743
01:01:44,928 --> 01:01:47,141
Subscribers aren't the problem right now!

744
01:01:47,141 --> 01:01:48,952
Shut up! Be quiet!

745
01:01:52,154 --> 01:01:54,837
If the client can't get a divorce now,

746
01:01:54,837 --> 01:01:59,686
as her lawyers, we just need to set up
an environment where she can divorce anytime.

747
01:02:06,182 --> 01:02:10,784
Honey, please. Honey!

748
01:02:16,691 --> 01:02:18,265
Do you see it now?

749
01:02:18,265 --> 01:02:20,515
That's what makes divorce cases different.

750
01:02:20,515 --> 01:02:23,913
Check your account. I sent you a success bonus.

751
01:02:27,565 --> 01:02:29,922
<i>I found it. The know-how.</i>

752
01:02:29,922 --> 01:02:32,299
Attorney Kang, let's head out.

753
01:02:32,299 --> 01:02:34,046
Yes, ma'am.

754
01:02:39,702 --> 01:02:41,280
Ma'am.

755
01:02:41,982 --> 01:02:44,216
Come to think of it, this is a first.

756
01:02:44,216 --> 01:02:49,265
Since we met as opposing counsel,
calling me "ma'am" must feel awkward, right?

757
01:02:49,938 --> 01:02:52,699
No. It's not awkward at all.

758
01:02:52,699 --> 01:02:55,404
I want to learn a lot from you.

759
01:02:56,901 --> 01:03:00,296
<i>I'll be a good partner
to Cha Eun Kyung as Kang Hye Seong.</i>

760
01:03:11,806 --> 01:03:14,760
[Epilogue]

761
01:03:24,388 --> 01:03:25,983
<i>Thank you, Attorney.</i>

762
01:03:25,983 --> 01:03:29,742
<i>I'm doing my first
livestream on my channel today. Come watch!</i>

763
01:03:29,742 --> 01:03:32,012
What's she talking about?

764
01:03:37,667 --> 01:03:40,832
[Lee Young Mi]

765
01:03:40,832 --> 01:03:42,854
[Big Sister Young Mi]

766
01:03:46,407 --> 01:03:48,533
<i>Hello, everyone.</i>

767
01:03:48,533 --> 01:03:51,533
<i>It's Big Sister Young Mi, Lee Young Mi.</i>

768
01:03:51,533 --> 01:03:57,192
<i>This is my first livestream on my own channel,
so I'm very nervous.</i>

769
01:03:57,192 --> 01:04:00,346
<i>Wow, 100,000 subscribers already!</i>

770
01:04:00,346 --> 01:04:04,132
<i>How did I get this channel started?</i>

771
01:04:04,903 --> 01:04:08,511
<i>During the lawsuit,
Attorney Cha Eun Kyung told me...</i>

772
01:04:08,511 --> 01:04:14,162
<i>that I don't need to divorce now,
but I should open my channel right away.</i>

773
01:04:14,162 --> 01:04:17,694
<i>She said life after divorce is more important
than the divorce itself.</i>

774
01:04:17,694 --> 01:04:19,712
<i>I showed her what was in store for her.</i>

775
01:04:21,202 --> 01:04:24,145
<i>If you want to learn those things,
come be my associate.</i>

776
01:04:25,983 --> 01:04:28,982
So that's what she meant.

777
01:04:28,982 --> 01:04:33,092
<i>Right here on Big Sister Young Mi's channel,
not Lee Jun Sik TV.</i>

778
01:04:33,092 --> 01:04:37,572
<i>From now on, I'll continue Bedroom Talk alone,
not as a couple.</i>

779
01:04:38,282 --> 01:04:42,062
<i>I'm organizing the subscriber list now...</i>

780
01:04:42,062 --> 01:04:45,912
<i>And that will be Ms. Lee's space now.</i>

781
01:05:34,514 --> 01:05:37,851
<i>He may have married for the property division.</i>

782
01:05:37,851 --> 01:05:40,047
<i>I think he's practicing divorce investing.</i>

783
01:05:40,047 --> 01:05:42,494
<i>I even had a child to boost my share.</i>

784
01:05:42,494 --> 01:05:44,118
<i>This guy is a con artist.</i>

785
01:05:44,118 --> 01:05:46,858
<i>When did you do housework and childcare?</i>

786
01:05:46,858 --> 01:05:51,890
<i>Attorney Kang, are you sure
you stayed professional throughout?</i>
